timeshift-recovery (1.0.8) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Restore: the reconnect probe no longer shares the ssh ControlMaster socket - a client attaching to a wedged master never performs connect(2), so ConnectTimeout did not apply and the probe blocked instead of dialling afresh
  * Restore: drop the shared ssh connection before each reconnect attempt, and remove stale control sockets that rmdir could never reap
